#
# WHY THIS PATCH LIVES IN THE scraplan REPO:
#   ~/Desktop/plandata is NOT a git repository (no .git, not nested in one, and
#   data_p1 alone is 43 GB) so the authorised 'one commit in plandata' could not be
#   made. The change is applied and tested on disk; this patch is its reviewable,
#   version-controlled record, kept in a repo this window owns.
#
# Apply/revert from /home/gis-syr/Desktop/plandata with:
#   patch -p1 < deploy/adsb_scraper-aoi-gate.patch      # apply
#   patch -p1 -R < deploy/adsb_scraper-aoi-gate.patch   # revert
#
# Effective date: 2026-07-29. The precise effective instant is the collector
# restart recorded in docs/PROJECT_STATE.md §7 (ground-truth line).
#
# Gate: reuses the validator's existing ValidationFlag.OUTSIDE_AREA and the same
# cfg.area.persist_out_of_area override the Accumulator has always applied to the
# ICAO catalogue. Nothing is recomputed; only the place it takes effect is new.
# Tests: 6 added in adsb_scraper/tests/test_statevector.py, driven through the REAL
# committed AOI asset. Suite 200 passed; ruff + mypy clean.

